"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+6 Enhancement Bonus</a>:</b> +6 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Armor_Class\" title=\"Armor Class\">Armor Class</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Resistance_(enchantment)\" title=\"Resistance (enchantment)\"> Resistance +6</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Resistance_(enchantment)\" title=\"Resistance (enchantment)\"> Resistance +6</a>:</b> Passive: +6 <a href=\"/page/Resistance_bonus\" title=\"Resistance bonus\">Resistance bonus</a> to Fortitude, Reflex, and Will Saving Throws.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\"> Constitution +7</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\"> Constitution +7</a></b>: This item gives the wearer improved health, granting a +7 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to Constitution.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Good_Luck\" title=\"Good Luck\">Good Luck  +2</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Good_Luck\" title=\"Good Luck\">Good Luck  +2</a>:</b> This item gives a +2 <a href=\"/page/Luck_bonus\" title=\"Luck bonus\">Luck bonus</a> to all saves and skill checks.</span></span></li>\n<li>Upgrades:\n<ul><li>5 <a href=\"/page/Commendation:_Clerics_of_Amaunator\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Commendation: Clerics of Amaunator\">Commendation: Clerics of Amaunator</a> adds <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Amaunator&#39;s_Blessing\" title=\"Named item sets\">Amaunator's Blessing</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Amaunator&#39;s_Blessing\" title=\"Named item sets\">Amaunator's Blessing</a>:</b> When all three items from the set are equipped, you will gain a 10% Enhancement discount to the Spell Point cost of all your spells.</span></span></li>\n<li>5 <a href=\"/page/Commendation:_Druids_of_the_King%27s_Forest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Commendation: Druids of the King&#39;s Forest\">Commendation: Druids of the King's Forest</a> adds <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Woodsman&#39;s_Guile\" title=\"Named item sets\">Woodsman's Guile</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Woodsman&#39;s_Guile\" title=\"Named item sets\">Woodsman's Guile</a>:</b> When all three items from the set are equipped, you will gain a +4 bonus to your To-Hit and +6 bonus to your Damage on any attack that would be considered a Sneak Attack.</span></span></li>\n<li>5 <a href=\"/page/Commendation:_Purple_Dragon_Knights\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Commendation: Purple Dragon Knights\">Commendation: Purple Dragon Knights</a> adds <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Knight&#39;s_Loyalty\" title=\"Named item sets\">Knight's Loyalty</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Knight&#39;s_Loyalty\" title=\"Named item sets\">Knight's Loyalty</a>:</b> When all three items from the set are equipped, you will gain a +3 <a href=\"/page/Artifact_bonus\" title=\"Artifact bonus\">artifact bonus</a> to your To-Hit and Damage rolls, and a +3 Insight bonus to Natural Armor.</span></span></li>\n<li>5 <a href=\"/page/Commendation:_Villagers_of_Eveningstar\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Commendation: Villagers of Eveningstar\">Commendation: Villagers of Eveningstar</a> adds <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Way_of_the_Sun_Soul\" title=\"Named item sets\">Way of the Sun Soul</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Way_of_the_Sun_Soul\" title=\"Named item sets\">Way of the Sun Soul</a>:</b> When all three item from the set are equipped and you are in a centered state, you will gain +2 <a href=\"/page/Artifact_bonus\" title=\"Artifact bonus\">artifact bonus</a> to To-Hit and Damage rolls. In addition, when you roll a natural 20 on an attack roll that is confirmed as a critical hit, you will gain temporary benefit based on the elemental stance you are in, if any.</span></span></li>\n<li>5 <a href=\"/page/Commendation:_War_Wizards\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Commendation: War Wizards\">Commendation: War Wizards</a> adds <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Battle_Arcanist\" title=\"Named item sets\">Battle Arcanist</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Battle_Arcanist\" title=\"Named item sets\">Battle Arcanist</a>:</b> When all three items from the set are equipped, you will gain a 10% <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement</a> discount to the Spell Point cost of all your spells.</span></span></li></ul></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Armor Boost</a> +2 or +4<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Armor Boost</a> +2 or +4:</b> +2 or +4 <a href=\"/page/Mythic_bonus\" title=\"Mythic bonus\">Mythic bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Physical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Physical Resistance Rating\">Physical</a> and <a href=\"/page/Magical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Magical Resistance Rating\">Magical</a> Resistance Ratings.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD;\" rowspan=\"5\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Ancient_Gemstone.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Ancient_Gemstone.png/420px-Ancient_Gemstone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"448\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Ancient_Gemstone.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><a href=\"/page/Commendations\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Commendations\"> Eveningstar Commendations Traders</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><i>This metal and gem-studded sphere was found in the ruined Temple of Mystra. It may have been used as a power source for some sort of magical device or construct.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Notes\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n<p>This item, like the others from this chain, can be acquired as an end reward for the chain as <a href=\"/page/Bind\" title=\"Bind\">Bound to Character&#160;on Acquire</a>.\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817200341\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.096 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.149 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 6357/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 40773/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 16387/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 6/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n117.11%  145.183     87 Template:IO\n100.00%  123.976      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  123.976      1 -total\n 95.80%  118.770      1 Template:Named_Armor\n 41.62%   51.599      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 39.96%   49.540      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 37.03%   45.906      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 34.94%   43.319      2 Template:InCategory\n 23.01%   28.527     12 Template:Popup\n 12.99%   16.101      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:24279-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817200341 and revision id 628258. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
